---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import PhotoPlaceholder from '../components/PhotoPlaceholder.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | Our Outsourced Accounting Team for UK Practices"
  description="Meet the outsourced accounting team behind SM Global: UK GAAP-trained, GDPR-compliant, and built to work as a genuine extension of your practice."
>
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1>We work as part of your practice, under your name</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        SM Global Accounting Services is an outsourcing team built around UK accountancy practices.
        We handle statutory accounts, personal tax, bookkeeping and compliance work, so your team can
        spend its time on advisory work and client relationships.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="split__head">
        <h2>What we believe</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="text-list">
        <div class="text-list__item">
          <h3>Your data stays in your systems</h3>
          <p>Every process is built around keeping client data inside your own systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-list__item">
          <h3>Your clients shouldn't notice we're there</h3>
          <p>We work under your brand, your templates and your quality standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-list__item">
          <h3>A relationship, not a ticket queue</h3>
          <p>Dedicated teams, regular check-ins and a named point of contact.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-list__item">
          <h3>We keep learning</h3>
          <p>Compliance rules, software and best practice keep changing, so staying current is part of the job. When there is a better way to do something, we adopt it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Trained on UK standards</h2>
      <p>
        Our accountants and bookkeepers are trained on UK GAAP, including FRS 102 (Section 1A) and
        FRS 105 for small companies and micro-entities. They also work to Making Tax Digital
        requirements, current HMRC filing deadlines and Companies House obligations. We don't adapt a
        generic process to UK rules. UK compliance is the process.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>How we got here</h2>
      <p>
        It started with one freelancer, one client and a blank page. A UK accountancy practice had
        just been incorporated and needed someone to turn that blank page into a working firm:
        company processes, internal workflow, company secretarial and administrative work, tax setup,
        and the year-end and bookkeeping software, all built from scratch.
      </p>
      <p>
        The client noticed, and handed over their entire processing workload to the person who had
        built it. That trust turned freelance work into something bigger. A subcontractor came on
        board, then joined as a full employee, and one freelancer's workload grew into a firm's.
      </p>
      <p>
        We became SM Global Accounting Services in 2025 to carry that work forward properly. The team
        has grown from one person to a small team since, without losing the hands-on way of working
        that got us here. Today we support that same practice's accounting workload, around 120–130
        clients in total: AML screening, client onboarding, company incorporation and company
        secretarial work, bookkeeping across the UK, US, UAE and beyond, and statutory accounts
        preparation and filing for UK companies.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The team</h2>
      <p class="lead">These are the people preparing your files.</p>
      <p class="placeholder-note" style="max-width: 44rem;">
        <strong>To be completed before launch:</strong> a photo, full name and a one-line description
        for each person below. See LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md, "Real content still needed".
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid--team" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        <div class="card">
          <PhotoPlaceholder compact ratio="1 / 1" label="Photo: Account Manager" note="Square, at least 600 × 600 px" />
          <p class="person-name person-name--todo">[Full name]</p>
          <h3>Account Manager</h3>
          <p>ACCA-certified, with 7+ years' experience in the financial field. Oversees the relationship and day-to-day priorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <PhotoPlaceholder compact ratio="1 / 1" label="Photo: Relationship Manager" note="Square, at least 600 × 600 px" />
          <p class="person-name person-name--todo">[Full name]</p>
          <h3>Relationship Manager</h3>
          <p>A dedicated person who builds and maintains the relationship, with the client and between our own team members.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <PhotoPlaceholder compact ratio="1 / 1" label="Photo: Client Manager" note="Square, at least 600 × 600 px" />
          <p class="person-name person-name--todo">[Full name]</p>
          <h3>Client Manager &amp; Senior Accountant</h3>
          <p>ACCA Affiliate. Leads day-to-day client work alongside senior-level review of files.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <PhotoPlaceholder compact ratio="1 / 1" label="Photo: Senior Accountant" note="Square, at least 600 × 600 px" />
          <p class="person-name person-name--todo">[Full name]</p>
          <h3>Senior Accountants</h3>
          <p>ACCA and CA Affiliate, with 10+ years' experience. Handle the core preparation work: bookkeeping, VAT, year-end accounts and tax computations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <PhotoPlaceholder compact ratio="1 / 1" label="Photo: Junior Accountant" note="Square, at least 600 × 600 px" />
          <p class="person-name person-name--todo">[Full name]</p>
          <h3>Junior Accountants</h3>
          <p>3+ years' experience. Support the preparation and processing work behind every file.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="link-teasers">
        <div class="link-teaser">
          <h3>How the team is organised</h3>
          <p>Who reviews what, who you will deal with day to day, and which software and areas of work each part of the team covers.</p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/team-structure">See our team structure →</a></p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/team-specialisation">See which software we specialise in →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="link-teaser">
          <h3>Data security</h3>
          <p>Your client data stays inside your own systems. This is how we keep it that way.</p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/data-security">Read about our data security →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <CtaBand headline="Want to see how we would fit into your practice?" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
